{"suttaId":"pv27","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Pv","vriCode":"s0507m.mul","paras":[1328,1426],"vripara":"408"},"segments":{"pv27:0.3":"Sāṇavāsītherapetavatthu","pv27:1.1":"Kuṇḍināgariyo thero, sāṇavāsi [sānuvāsi (sī.), sānavāsi (syā.)] nivāsiko;","pv27:1.3":"Poṭṭhapādoti nāmena, samaṇo bhāvitindriyo.","pv27:2.1":"Tassa mātā pitā bhātā, duggatā yamalokikā;","pv27:2.3":"Pāpakammaṃ karitvāna, petalokaṃ ito gatā.","pv27:3.1":"Te duggatā sūcikaṭṭā, kilantā naggino kisā;","pv27:3.3":"Uttasantā [ottappantā (syā. ka.)] mahattāsā [mahātāsā (sī.)], na dassenti kurūrino [kuruddino (ka.)].","pv27:4.1":"Tassa bhātā vitaritvā, naggo ekapathekako;","pv27:4.3":"Catukuṇḍiko bhavitvāna, therassa dassayītumaṃ.","pv27:5.1":"Thero cāmanasikatvā, tuṇhībhūto atikkami;","pv27:5.3":"So ca viññāpayī theraṃ,‘bhātā petagato ahaṃ’.","pv27:6.1":"“Mātā pitā ca te bhante, duggatā yamalokikā;","pv27:6.3":"Pāpakammaṃ karitvāna, petalokaṃ ito gatā.","pv27:7.1":"“Te duggatā sūcikaṭṭā, kilantā naggino kisā;","pv27:7.3":"Uttasantā mahattāsā, na dassenti kurūrino.","pv27:8.1":"“Anukampassu kāruṇiko, datvā anvādisāhi no;","pv27:8.3":"Tava dinnena dānena, yāpessanti kurūrino”ti.","pv27:9.1":"Thero caritvā piṇḍāya, bhikkhū aññe ca dvādasa;","pv27:9.3":"Ekajjhaṃ sannipatiṃsu, bhattavissaggakāraṇā.","pv27:10.1":"Thero sabbeva te āha,“yathāladdhaṃ dadātha me;","pv27:10.3":"Saṅghabhattaṃ karissāmi, anukampāya ñātinaṃ”.","pv27:11.1":"Niyyādayiṃsu therassa, thero saṅghaṃ nimantayi;","pv27:11.3":"Datvā anvādisi thero, mātu pitu ca bhātuno;","pv27:11.5":"“Idaṃ me ñātīnaṃ hotu, sukhitā hontu ñātayo”.","pv27:12.1":"Samanantarānuddiṭṭhe, bhojanaṃ udapajjatha;","pv27:12.3":"Suciṃ paṇītaṃ sampannaṃ, anekarasabyañjanaṃ.","pv27:13.1":"Tato uddassayī [uddisayī (sī. ka.), uddissati (syā. ka.)] bhātā, vaṇṇavā balavā sukhī;","pv27:13.3":"“Pahūtaṃ bhojanaṃ bhante, passa naggāmhase mayaṃ;","pv27:13.5":"Tathā bhante parakkama, yathā vatthaṃ labhāmase”ti.","pv27:14.1":"Thero saṅkārakūṭamhā, uccinitvāna nantake;","pv27:14.3":"Pilotikaṃ paṭaṃ katvā, saṅghe cātuddise adā.","pv27:15.1":"Datvā anvādisī thero, mātu pitu ca bhātuno;","pv27:15.3":"“Idaṃ me ñātīnaṃ hotu, sukhitā hontu ñātayo”.","pv27:16.1":"Samanantarānuddiṭṭhe, vatthāni udapajjisuṃ;","pv27:16.3":"Tato suvatthavasano, therassa dassayītumaṃ.","pv27:17.1":"“Yāvatā nandarājassa, vijitasmiṃ paṭicchadā;","pv27:17.3":"Tato bahutarā bhante, vatthānacchādanāni no.","pv27:18.1":"“Koseyyakambalīyāni, khoma kappāsikāni ca;","pv27:18.3":"Vipulā ca mahagghā ca, tepākāsevalambare.","pv27:19.1":"“Te mayaṃ paridahāma, yaṃ yaṃ hi manaso piyaṃ;","pv27:19.3":"Tathā bhante parakkama, yathā gehaṃ labhāmase”ti.","pv27:20.1":"Thero paṇṇakuṭiṃ katvā, saṅghe cātuddise adā;","pv27:20.3":"Datvā anvādisī thero, mātu pitu ca bhātuno;","pv27:20.5":"“Idaṃ me ñātīnaṃ hotu, sukhitā hontu ñātayo”.","pv27:21.1":"Samanantarānuddiṭṭhe, gharāni udapajjisuṃ;","pv27:21.3":"Kūṭāgāranivesanā, vibhattā bhāgaso mitā.","pv27:22.1":"“Na manussesu īdisā, yādisā no gharā idha;","pv27:22.3":"Api dibbesu yādisā, tādisā no gharā idha.","pv27:23.1":"“Daddallamānā ābhenti [ābhanti (ka.)], samantā caturo disā;","pv27:23.3":"‘Tathā bhante parakkama, yathā pānīyaṃ labhāmase”ti.","pv27:24.1":"Thero karaṇaṃ [karakaṃ (sī. syā. pī.)] pūretvā, saṅghe cātuddise adā;","pv27:24.3":"Datvā anvādisī thero, mātu pitu ca bhātuno;","pv27:24.5":"“Idaṃ me ñātīnaṃ hotu, sukhitā hontu ñātayo’.","pv27:25.1":"Samanantarānuddiṭṭhe, pānīyaṃ udapajjatha;","pv27:25.3":"Gambhīrā caturassā ca, pokkharañño sunimmitā.","pv27:26.1":"Sītodikā suppatitthā, sītā appaṭigandhiyā;","pv27:26.3":"Padumuppalasañchannā, vārikiñjakkhapūritā.","pv27:27.1":"Tattha nhatvā pivitvā ca, therassa paṭidassayuṃ;","pv27:27.3":"“Pahūtaṃ pānīyaṃ bhante, pādā dukkhā phalanti no”.","pv27:28.1":"“Āhiṇḍamānā khañjāma, sakkhare kusakaṇṭake;","pv27:28.3":"‘Tathā bhante parakkama, yathā yānaṃ labhāmase’”ti.","pv27:29.1":"Thero sipāṭikaṃ laddhā, saṅghe cātuddise adā;","pv27:29.3":"Datvā anvādisī thero, mātu pitu ca bhātuno;","pv27:29.5":"“Idaṃ me ñātīnaṃ hotu, sukhitā hontu ñātayo”.","pv27:30.1":"Samanantarānuddiṭṭhe, petā rathena māgamuṃ;","pv27:30.3":"“Anukampitamha bhadante, bhattenacchādanena ca.","pv27:31.1":"“Gharena pānīyadānena, yānadānena cūbhayaṃ;","pv27:31.3":"Muniṃ kāruṇikaṃ loke, bhante vanditumāgatā”ti.","pv27:32.1":"Sāṇavāsītherapetavatthu dutiyaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Pv-a","bookName":"Petavatthu-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0507a.att","from":1832,"to":1921,"paras":[{"para":1832,"vripara":"408-409","refs":["pv27:1"],"words":["kuṇḍināgariyo thero","sāṇavāsinivāsiko","poṭṭhapādoti nāmenā","samaṇo","bhāvitindriyo"],"lines":["408-9. Tattha <b>kuṇḍināgariyo thero</b>ti evaṃnāmake nagare jātasaṃvaḍḍhatthero,“kuṇḍikanagaro thero” tipi pāṭho, so evattho.","<b>Sāṇavāsinivāsiko</b>ti sāṇapabbatavāsī.","<b>Poṭṭhapādoti nāmenā</b>ti nāmena poṭṭhapādo nāma.","<b>Samaṇo</b>ti samitapāpo.","<b>Bhāvitindriyo</b>ti ariyamaggabhāvanāya bhāvitasaddhādiindriyo, arahāti attho.","<b>Tassā</b>ti tassa sāṇavāsittherassa.","<b>Duggatā</b>ti duggatigatā."],"lineRefs":[["pv27:1"],["pv27:1"],["pv27:1"],["pv27:1"],["pv27:1"],["pv27:1"],["pv27:1"]]},{"para":1833,"vripara":"410","refs":["pv27:3"],"words":["sūcikaṭṭā","kilantā","naggino","kisā","uttasantā","mahattāsā","na dassentī","kurūrino"],"lines":["<b>Sūcikaṭṭā</b>ti pūtinā lūkhagattā aṭṭakā, sūcikāti laddhanāmāya khuppipāsāya aṭṭā pīḷitā.","“Sūcikaṇṭhā”ti keci paṭhanti, sūcichiddasadisamukhadvārāti attho.","<b>Kilantā</b>ti kilantakāyacittā.","<b>Naggino</b>ti naggarūpā niccoḷā.","<b>Kisā</b>ti aṭṭhittacamattasarīratāya kisadehā.","<b>Uttasantā</b>ti “ayaṃ samaṇo amhākaṃ putto”ti ottappena utrāsaṃ āpajjantā.","<b>Mahattāsā</b>ti attanā pubbe katakammaṃ paṭicca sañjātamahābhayā.","<b>Na dassentī</b>ti attānaṃ na dassenti, sammukhībhāvaṃ na gacchanti.","<b>Kurūrino</b>ti dāruṇakammantā."],"lineRefs":[["pv27:3"],["pv27:3"],["pv27:3"],["pv27:3"],["pv27:3"],["pv27:3"],["pv27:3"],["pv27:3"],["pv27:3"]]},{"para":1834,"vripara":"411","refs":["pv27:4"],"words":["tassa bhātā","vitaritvā","ekapathe","ekako","catukuṇḍiko bhavitvānā","therassa dassayītumaṃ"],"lines":["<b>Tassa bhātā</b>ti sāṇavāsittherassa bhātā.","<b>Vitaritvā</b>ti vitiṇṇo hutvā, ottappasantāsabhayāti attho.","Vituritvāti vā pāṭho, turito hutvā, taramānarūpo hutvāti vuttaṃ hoti.","<b>Ekapathe</b>ti ekapadikamagge.","<b>Ekako</b>ti ekiko adutiyo.","<b>Catukuṇḍiko bhavitvānā</b>ti catūhi aṅgehi kuṇḍeti attabhāvaṃ pavattetīti catukuṇḍiko, dvīhi jāṇūhi dvīhi hatthehi gacchanto tiṭṭhanto ca, evaṃbhūto hutvāti attho.","So hi evaṃ purato kopīnapaṭicchādanā hotīti tathā akāsi.","<b>Therassa dassayītuman</b>ti therassa attānaṃ uddisayi dassesi."],"lineRefs":[["pv27:4"],["pv27:4"],["pv27:4"],["pv27:4"],["pv27:4"],["pv27:4"],["pv27:4"],["pv27:4"]]},{"para":1835,"vripara":"412","refs":["pv27:5"],"words":["so cā","bhātā petagato ahaṃ"],"lines":["<b>Amanasikatvā</b>ti “ayaṃ nāma eso”ti evaṃ manasi akaritvā anāvajjetvā.","<b>So cā</b>ti so peto.","<b>Bhātā petagato ahan</b>ti “ahaṃ atītattabhāve bhātā, idāni petabhūto idhāgato”ti vatvā viññāpayi theranti yojanā."],"lineRefs":[["pv27:5"],["pv27:5"],["pv27:5"]]},{"para":1836,"vripara":"413-415","refs":["pv27:6"],"words":["mātā pitā cā","mātā pitā ca te"],"lines":["413-5. Yathā pana viññāpayi, taṃ dassetuṃ <b>“mātā pitā cā”</b>tiādinā tisso gāthā vuttā.","Tattha <b>mātā pitā ca te</b>ti tava mātā ca pitā ca.","<b>Anukampassū</b>ti anuggaṇha anudayaṃ karohi.","<b>Anvādisāhī</b>ti ādisa.","<b>No</b>ti amhākaṃ.","<b>Tava dinnenā</b>ti tayā dinnena."],"lineRefs":[["pv27:6"],["pv27:6"],["pv27:6"],["pv27:6"],["pv27:6"],["pv27:6"]]},{"para":1837,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Taṃ sutvā thero yathā paṭipajji, taṃ dassetuṃ –"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1839,"vripara":"416","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Thero caritvā piṇḍāya, bhikkhū aññe ca dvādasa;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1840,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Ekajjhaṃ sannipatiṃsu, bhattavissaggakāraṇā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1842,"vripara":"417","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Thero sabbeva te āha, yathāladdhaṃ dadātha me;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1843,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Saṅghabhattaṃ karissāmi, anukampāya ñātinaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1845,"vripara":"418","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Niyyādayiṃsu therassa, thero saṅghaṃ nimantayi;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1846,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Datvā anvādisi thero, mātu pitu ca bhātuno;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1847,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["‘Idaṃ me ñātīnaṃ hotu, sukhitā hontu ñātayo’."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1849,"vripara":"419","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Samanantarānuddiṭṭhe, bhojanaṃ udapajjatha;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1850,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Suciṃ paṇītaṃ sampannaṃ, anekarasabyañjanaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1852,"vripara":"420","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Tato uddassayī bhātā, vaṇṇavā balavā sukhī;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1853,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Pahūtaṃ bhojanaṃ bhante, passa naggāmhase mayaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1854,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Tathā bhante parakkama, yathā vatthaṃ labhāmase."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1856,"vripara":"421","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Thero saṅkārakūṭamhā, uccinitvāna nantake;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1857,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Pilotikaṃ paṭaṃ katvā, saṅghe cātuddise adā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1859,"vripara":"422","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Datvā anvādisī thero, mātu pitu ca bhātuno;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1860,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["‘Idaṃ me ñātīnaṃ hotu, sukhitā hontu ñātayo’."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1862,"vripara":"423","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Samanantarānuddiṭṭhe, vatthāni udapajjisuṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1863,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Tato suvatthavasano, therassa dassayītumaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1865,"vripara":"424","re