atvā anvādisī thero, mātu pitu ca bhātuno;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1889,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["‘Idaṃ me ñātīnaṃ hotu, sukhitā hontu ñātayo’."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1891,"vripara":"432","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Samanantarānuddiṭṭhe, pānīyaṃ udapajjatha;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1892,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Gambhīrā caturassā ca, pokkharañño sunimmitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1894,"vripara":"433","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Sītodikā suppatitthā, sītā appaṭigandhiyā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1895,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Padumuppalasañchannā, vārikiñjakkhapūritā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1897,"vripara":"434","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Tattha nhatvā pivitvā ca, therassa paṭidassayuṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1898,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Pahūtaṃ pānīyaṃ bhante, pādā dukkhā phalanti no."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1900,"vripara":"435","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Āhiṇḍamānā khañjāma, sakkhare kusakaṇṭake;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1901,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Tathā bhante parakkama, yathā yānaṃ labhāmase."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1903,"vripara":"436","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Thero sipāṭikaṃ laddhā, saṅghe cātuddise adā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1904,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Datvā anvādisī thero, mātu pitu ca bhātuno;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1905,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["‘Idaṃ me ñātīnaṃ hotu, sukhitā hontu ñātayo’."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1907,"vripara":"437","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Samanantarānuddiṭṭhe, petā rathena māgamuṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1908,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Anukampitamha bhadante, bhattenacchādanena ca."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1910,"vripara":"438","refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["“Gharena pānīyadānena, yānadānena cūbhayaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1911,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"words":[],"lines":["Muniṃ kāruṇikaṃ loke, bhante vanditumāgatā”ti.","– gāthāyo āhaṃsu;"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":1912,"vripara":"416-417","refs":["pv27:9"],"words":["thero caritvā piṇḍāyā","bhikkhū aññe ca dvādasā","ekajjhaṃ","sannipatiṃsu","bhattavissaggakāraṇā"],"lines":["416-7. Tattha <b>thero caritvā piṇḍāyā</b>ti thero piṇḍāpātacārikāya caritvā.","<b>Bhikkhū aññe ca dvādasā</b>ti therena saha vasantā aññe ca dvādasa bhikkhū <b>ekajjhaṃ</b> ekato <b>sannipatiṃsu</b>.","Kasmāti ce?","<b>Bhattavissaggakāraṇā</b>ti bhattakiccakāraṇā bhuñjananimittaṃ.","<b>Te</b>ti te bhikkhū.","<b>Yathāladdhan</b>ti yaṃ yaṃ laddhaṃ.","<b>Dadāthā</b>ti detha."],"lineRefs":[["pv27:9"],["pv27:9"],["pv27:9"],["pv27:9"],["pv27:9"],["pv27:9"],["pv27:9"]]},{"para":1913,"vripara":"418","refs":["pv27:11"],"words":["niyyādayiṃsū","saṅghaṃ nimantayī","anvādisī"],"lines":["<b>Niyyādayiṃsū</b>ti adaṃsu.","<b>Saṅghaṃ nimantayī</b>ti te eva dvādasa bhikkhū saṅghuddesavasena taṃ bhattaṃ dātuṃ nimantesi.","<b>Anvādisī</b>ti ādisi.","Tattha yesaṃ anvādisi, te dassetuṃ <b>“mātu pitu ca bhātuno, idaṃ me ñātīnaṃ hotu, sukhitā hontu ñātayo”</b>ti vuttaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["pv27:11"],["pv27:11"],["pv27:11"],["pv27:11"]]},{"para":1914,"vripara":"419","refs":["pv27:12"],"words":["samanantarānuddiṭṭhe","bhojanaṃ udapajjathā","suciṃ","anekarasabyañjanaṃ"],"lines":["<b>Samanantarānuddiṭṭhe</b>ti uddiṭṭhasamanantarameva.","<b>Bhojanaṃ udapajjathā</b>ti tesaṃ petānaṃ bhojanaṃ uppajji.","Kīdisanti āha <b>“sucin”</b>tiādi.","Tattha <b>anekarasabyañjanan</b>ti nānārasehi byañjanehi yuttaṃ, atha vā anekarasaṃ anekabyañjanañca.","<b>Tato</b>ti bhojanalābhato pacchā."],"lineRefs":[["pv27:12"],["pv27:12"],["pv27:12"],["pv27:12"],["pv27:12"]]},{"para":1915,"vripara":"420","refs":["pv27:13"],"words":["uddassayī bhātā","vaṇṇavā balavā sukhī","pahūtaṃ bhojanaṃ  bhante","passa naggāmhase","parakkama","yathā vatthaṃ labhāmase"],"lines":["<b>Uddassayī bhātā</b>ti bhātikabhūto peto therassa attānaṃ dassesi.","<b>Vaṇṇavā balavā sukhī</b>ti tena bhojanalābhena tāvadeva rūpasampanno balasampanno sukhitova hutvā.","<b>Pahūtaṃ bhojanaṃ, bhante</b>ti, bhante, tava dānānubhāvena pahūtaṃ anappakaṃ bhojanaṃ amhehi laddhaṃ.","<b>Passa naggāmhase</b>ti olokehi, naggikā pana amha, tasmā tathā, bhante, <b>parakkama</b> payogaṃ karohi.","<b>Yathā vatthaṃ labhāmase</b>ti yena pakārena yādisena payogena sabbeva mayaṃ vatthāni labheyyāma, tathā vāyamathāti attho."],"lineRefs":[["pv27:13"],["pv27:13"],["pv27:13"],["pv27:13"],["pv27:13"]]},{"para":1916,"vripara":"421","refs":["pv27:14"],"words":["saṅkārakūṭamhā","uccinitvānā","nantake","pilotikaṃ paṭaṃ katvā  saṅghe cātuddise adā","saṅghe cātuddise adā"],"lines":["<b>Saṅkārakūṭamhā</b>ti tattha tattha saṅkāraṭṭhānato.","<b>Uccinitvānā</b>ti gavesanavasena gahetvā.","<b>Nantake</b>ti chinnapariyante chaḍḍitadussakhaṇḍe.","Te pana yasmā khaṇḍabhūtā pilotikā nāma honti, tāhi ca thero cīvaraṃ katvā saṅghassa adāsi, tasmā āha <b>“pilotikaṃ paṭaṃ katvā, saṅghe cātuddise adā”</b>ti.","Tattha <b>saṅghe cātuddise adā</b>ti catūhipi disāhi āgatabhikkhusaṅghassa adāsi.","Sampadānatthe hi idaṃ bhummavacanaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["pv27:14"],["pv27:14"],["pv27:14"],["pv27:14"],["pv27:14"],["pv27:14"]]},{"para":1917,"vripara":"423-424","refs":["pv27:16"],"words":["suvatthavasano","therassa dassayītumaṃ"],"lines":["423-4. <b>Suvatthavasano</b>ti sundaravatthavasano.","<b>Therassa dassayītuman</b>ti therassa attānaṃ dassayi dassesi, pākaṭo ahosi.","Paṭicchādayati etthāti <b>paṭicchadā</b>."],"lineRefs":[["pv27:16"],["pv27:16"],["pv27:16"]]},{"para":1918,"vripara":"428-429","refs":["pv27:21"],"words":["kūṭāgāranivesanā","vibhattā","bhāgaso mitā"],"lines":["428-9. <b>Kūṭāgāranivesanā</b>ti kūṭāgārabhūtā tadaññanivesanasaṅkhātā ca gharā.","Liṅgavipallāsavasena hetaṃ vuttaṃ.","<b>Vibhattā</b>ti samacaturassaāyatavaṭṭasaṇṭhānādivasena vibhattā.","<b>Bhāgaso mitā</b>ti bhāgena paricchinnā.","<b>No</b>ti amhākaṃ.","<b>Idhā</b>ti imasmiṃ petaloke.","<b>Api dibbesū</b>ti <b>apī</b>ti nipātamattaṃ, devalokesūti attho."],"lineRefs":[["pv27:21"],["pv27:21"],["pv27:21"],["pv27:21"],["pv27:21"],["pv27:21"],["pv27:21"]]},{"para":1919,"vripara":"431","refs":["pv27:24"],"words":["karaṇaṃ","pūretvā"],"lines":["<b>Karaṇan</b>ti dhamakaraṇaṃ.","<b>Pūretvā</b>ti udakassa pūretvā.","<b>Vārikiñjakkhapūritā</b>ti tattha tattha vārimatthake padumuppalādīnaṃ kesarabhārehi sañchāditavasena pūritā.","<b>Phalantī</b>ti pupphanti, paṇhikapariyantādīsu vidālentīti attho."],"lineRefs":[["pv27:24"],["pv27:24"],["pv27:24"],["pv27:24"]]},{"para":1920,"vripara":"435-436","refs":["pv27:28"],"words":["āhiṇḍamānā","khañjāmā","sakkhare kusakaṇṭake","yānaṃ"],"lines":["435-6. <b>Āhiṇḍamānā</b>ti vicaramānā.","<b>Khañjāmā</b>ti khañjanavasena gacchāma.","<b>Sakkhare kusakaṇṭake</b>ti sakkharavati kusakaṇṭakavati ca bhūmibhāge, sakkhare kusakaṇṭake ca akkamantāti attho.","<b>Yānan</b>ti rathavayhādikaṃ yaṃkiñci yānaṃ.","<b>Sipāṭikan</b>ti ekapaṭalaupāhanaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["pv27:28"],["pv27:28"],["pv27:28"],["pv27:28"],["pv27:28"]]},{"para":1921,"vripara":"437-438","refs":["pv27:30"],"words":["rathena māgamuṃ"],"lines":["437-8. <b>Rathena māgamun</b>ti makāro padasandhikaro, rathena āgamaṃsu.","<b>Ubhayan</b>ti ubhayena dānena, yānadānena ceva bhattādicatupaccayadānena ca.","Pānīyadānena hettha bhesajjadānampi saṅgahitaṃ.","Sesaṃ heṭṭhā vuttanayattā uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["pv27:30"],["pv27:30"],["pv27:30"],["pv27:30"]]}]},"tika":null}
